  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 21 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}看多少次都是美少年……\n这才是永不解除的魔法……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 21 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}厉害吗？\n小熊厉害吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}就是因为你这么宠着，\n这家伙才会得寸进尺！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 21 01 09 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}不要啊！\n至少老师，\n不要抛弃小熊啊！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}确实，直斗的手很巧呢。\n帮我换过手表电池，\n伞坏掉时也帮我修好了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}要这么说，完二也一样吧。\n你们看过完二做的针织玩偶吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:18:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}连衣服都是亲手做的，\n那真是……精致到令人叹为观止！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}没有那么夸张……确实有啦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}这样想来，直斗和完二\n说不定有点像呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}哎，不可能吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0202",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}不可能……也不是完全不像。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}啊、啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}我和巽同学……吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0A 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}啊，我有点懂。\n虽然手很巧，\n但整体上都很笨拙之类的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}整体上！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}嗯，就是这样！\n很像哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……可是，怎么说呢……\n我觉得直斗应该会讨厌这样说……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0F 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 01}不……虽然我自己不太明白，\n但既然大家都这么说，\n那一定是这样吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:29:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 01}和大家在一起，\n总能看到不同的自己……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:29:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 01}而且不知为什么，\n我总是不讨厌那个新的自己。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0272",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}……很不可思议吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:31:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 01}我觉得没什么不可思议的。\n所谓伙伴，不就是这样吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:32:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 04 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 24 01}所谓伙伴……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 01}我想，并不是聊得投机、\n关系好，就能叫伙伴。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:33:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 01}但说是为了同一个目的\n而聚在一起，好像也不太对……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:34:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0302",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 86 03 01 09 01 04 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 27 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}你自己也不知道啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:36:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 29 01}什么算伙伴，每个人想法都不同吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
