  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 10 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2C 01}花村学长……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:38:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0F 01 04 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 01}能找到自己喜欢的自己，\n不就是因为有伙伴在吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:38:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2E 01}如果只有自己一个人，\n大概就找不到新的自己了吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:39:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2F 01}是大家在改变着我……\n就是这个意思吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:40:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0352",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 30 01}这么一想，还真令人期待。\n今后的我会怎样改变，\n又能变成什么样呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}一起改变吧{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:41:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}直斗保持现在这样就好{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:41:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}今后也请多关照{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:42:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 31 01}呵呵，好的。\n见证学长的改变，\n应该也很有趣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:43:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_038",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 32 01}呵呵，没关系。\n我不会勉强自己，\n真有问题也会找你商量。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e500/e510_080.bf.json:44:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 33 01}呵呵，好的。\n今后也请多多关照。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
